{
  "id": "ALAS2-2026-4125",
  "title": "Amazon Linux 2 2017.12 - ALAS2-2026-4125: important priority package update for golang",
  "issued": {
    "date": "2026-11-17 09:00:00"
  },
  "updated": {
    "date": "2026-11-17 09:00:00"
  },
  "severity": "important",
  "description": "Package updates are available for Amazon Linux 2 that fix the following vulnerabilities:\nCVE-2026-97054:\n\tnet/http: HTTP/1 server crash due to MaxBytesReader header race\n\nCVE-2026-97043:\n\tcmd/go, cmd/compile: unexpected code execution via escaped quotes in //go:cgo_ldflag\n\nCVE-2026-97042:\n\tcmd/cgo, cmd/compile, cmd/link: linker flag injection via cgo_import_dynamic and PE DLL names\n\nCVE-2026-97041:\n\tcmd/compile, cmd/link: host linker flag injection via //go:cgo_* directives\n\nCVE-2026-97040:\n\tcmd/go, cmd/link: cgo directive injection via .syso files disguised as Go object files\n\nCVE-2026-97039:\n\tcmd/go: flag sanitization bypass via \"#cgo pkg-config:\" directives\n\nCVE-2026-97038:\n\tcmd/go: arbitrary code execution via crafted .syso files and cgo linker input files\n\nCVE-2026-97037:\n\tcmd/go: linker script injection via split -Wl, flags and Darwin or symbol linker flags in cgo\n\nCVE-2026-97035:\n\tcmd/go: unexpected code execution and arbitrary file write via Clang -gen-* and GCC -gnat* flags in cgo\n\nCVE-2026-97034:\n\tcmd/go: arbitrary command execution via GCC spec files in cgo linker search directories\n\nCVE-2026-97033:\n\tcmd/go: unexpected code execution via --sysroot, -target, -isysroot, -Wl,-syslibroot, and -x cgo flags\n",
